    <text id="0" type="text/plain" rect="(30, 10, 260, 90)">1. Open File and choose a local dataset (for example, iris.tab from Orange's sample datasets).</text>
    <text id="1" type="text/plain" rect="(420, 390, 400, 70)">2. Inspect trajectories, then click Start in Formal Loop Monitor. Model approval and symbolic expert contributions are reported separately.</text>
